<title>USA: U.S. cold storage stocks - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. cold storage stocks - USDA.</headline>
<text>
<p>WASHINGTON, March 21 (Reuter) U.S. Agriculture Department report of cold storage stocks, in 1,000 lbs:</p>
<p> Frozen Pork:	  02/28/97   01/31/97---Rev from   02/29/96</p>
<p> -Picnics, Bone-In	9,008	6,577	6,510	9,001</p>
<p> -Hams, Boneless	 29,035     24,056     24,056     25,246</p>
<p> -Hams, Bone-In	  26,799     25,726     25,734     29,621</p>
<p> -Bellies		  43,881     38,030     38,041     46,381</p>
<p> -Loins		    20,230     19,615     19,624     19,211</p>
<p> -Spareribs		71,133     72,938     72,988     61,595</p>
<p> -Trimmings		46,676     34,557     32,512     53,277</p>
<p> -Other Pork	     93,112     79,128     79,133     86,274</p>
<p>    (1,000 lbs):     02/28/97   01/31/97---Rev from   02/29/96</p>
<p> Total Frozen Pork    387,027    344,483    342,411    385,532</p>
<p> Frozen Beef	    260,836    290,309    290,305    362,615</p>
<p> Other Frozen Meat     16,495     16,719     16,350     19,523</p>
<p> Canned Hams		6,766	5,923	5,932     12,388</p>
<p> Other Canned Meat	1,088	  899	  899	1,523</p>
<p> Total Red Meats	672,212    658,333    655,897    781,581</p>
<p> Frzn Whole Broilers   42,862     39,360     39,392     39,838</p>
<p> Frzn Whole Turkeys   236,516    195,359    194,225    243,484</p>
<p> Frzn Turkey Parts    209,926    205,686    206,203    179,617</p>
<p>Total Frzn Poultry 1,147,221  1,079,012  1,083,012  1,094,531  </p>
<p>Total frozen poultry also includes hens, other chicken and ducks. Whole broilers also include fryers and roasters.</p>
<p>    (1,000 lbs)	02/28/97   01/31/97---Rev from   02/29/96</p>
<p> Butter		    24,292     21,181     21,738     33,670</p>
<p> -Govt.-Owned Butter	347	  161	  204	3,512</p>
<p>USDA said February 28 stocks of pork bellies were up 15 percent from stocks on January 31, but were five percent below stocks on Feb 29, 1996.</p>
